---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import PlanGrid from '../../components/PlanGrid.astro';
import OfferJsonLd from '../../components/OfferJsonLd.astro';
import { aiPlans, money } from '../../data/content';
---
<Base
  title="AI visibility for dental implant clinics"
  description="Hero Digital works with Australian dental implant and full-arch clinics on AI and Google visibility. Start with a free audit. Targets are aims, not guarantees."
  path="/dental-implants/"
>
  <OfferJsonLd offers={aiPlans.map((p) => ({ name: `AI Visibility ${p.name}`, path: '/ai-visibility/', description: p.who, price: p.price, priceType: 'month' as const }))} />
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Dental implants"
    title="Built for implant and full-arch clinics, not for every dentist."
    lead="We start in South East Queensland and work with clinics across Australia. The offer, the compliance checks and the content templates are all built around implant and All-on-4 questions patients actually ask."
    crumbs={[{ href: '/', label: 'Home' }, { href: '/dental-implants/', label: 'Dental implants' }]}
  />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="split">
        <article class="block">
          <h3><a href="/ai-visibility/">AI Visibility pricing</a></h3>
          <p>The same public ladder, written for implant principals: instant audit, $1,495 sprint, then Starter, Growth and Premium.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="block">
          <h3><a href="/dental-implants/ahpra-compliance/">Ahpra compliance</a></h3>
          <p>How public work is pre-screened, human-reviewed and approved by you. This is operational practice, not legal advice.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="block">
          <h3><a href="/dental-implants/full-arch/">Full-arch and All-on-4</a></h3>
          <p>The Premium plan and Hero One are designed for centres competing on full-arch questions across a city.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <h2 id="pricing" style="margin-top:48px">What an implant clinic actually pays.</h2>
      <p class="lead">The figures below are the same public prices as the rest of the site. Setup is {money(1995)}. The $1,495 Fix Sprint is credited toward setup if you then take a plan.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:28px">
        <PlanGrid plans={aiPlans} />
      </div>
      <p class="fine" style="margin-top:22px">Extra location {money(1995)} a month plus {money(995)} setup. Growth and website packages live on their own pages. Hero One is $9,995 a month, by application.</p>
      <h2 style="margin-top:48px">City pages</h2>
      <p class="lead">Local pages for the first cities we are building out. We do not invent local case numbers.</p>
      <div class="city-grid" style="margin-top:20px">
        <a class="block" href="/dental-implants/brisbane/"><h3>Brisbane</h3><p>Our home base. South East Queensland is where we start outreach and delivery.</p></a>
        <a class="block" href="/dental-implants/sydney/"><h3>Sydney</h3><p>A planned city page for implant clinics in Greater Sydney.</p></a>
        <a class="block" href="/dental-implants/melbourne/"><h3>Melbourne</h3><p>A planned city page for implant clinics in Greater Melbourne.</p></a>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:36px">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/#audit">Get a free audit</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/ai-visibility/">How AI visibility works</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
